    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave 1 CRITICAL gap remediation — regression tests. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Covers the following fix classes from src/storage/MODULE_GAPS.md Wave 1:</para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para>exception_in_destructor — CompactionManager and IndexMaintenanceManager destructors must be noexcept.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>smart_ptr_misuse — StreamingIngestManager::create() must return a valid non-null unique_ptr and reject null db.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>no_transit_encryption — WebDAVBlobBackend must reject plain HTTP URLs and reject verify_ssl=false unless THEMIS_ALLOW_INSECURE_WEBDAV is set.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>path_traversal — BackupManager::calculateChecksum must reject paths outside the database root.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>braces_imbalance — All six flagged source files must compile and link without error (structural compile check).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>unchecked_cuda_call — THEMIS_CUDA_CHECK macro must be defined and expand to a no-op when CUDA is disabled.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>Wave 1 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-08-25 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
